sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as odh-model-controller<br/>Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as odh-model-controller<br/>Reconciler
    participant ServerAPI as model-serving-api<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS FIPS
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant NGC as NVIDIA NGC API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Thanos Querier<br/>9091/TCP
    participant ModelReg as Model Registry<br/>HTTPS
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP
    participant Gateway as Gateway API<br/>Envoy + Authorino

    Note over User, Gateway: Flow 1: InferenceService Deployment with Route and Monitoring

    User->>K8sAPI: POST InferenceService<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutating Admission<br/>TLS (API server client cert)
    Webhook->>K8sAPI: Lookup Secret, HardwareProfile<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Inject credentials + scheduling
    K8sAPI-->>User: ISVC created

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch event received
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create Route, ServiceMonitor,<br/>Metrics Service, ConfigMap<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    Controller->>ModelReg: Sync ISVC metadata<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Prometheus->>Controller: Scrape /metrics<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over User, Gateway: Flow 2: LLMInferenceService with Gateway API Auth

    User->>K8sAPI: POST LLMInferenceService<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Mutating Admission (ConnectionsAPI,<br/>HardwareProfile)<br/>TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Inject credentials + scheduling
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create AuthPolicy for HTTPRoute<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create EnvoyFilter, PodMonitor<br/>per Gateway
    User->>Gateway: Inference request<br/>HTTPS / Kuadrant AuthPolicy

    Note over User, Gateway: Flow 3: NIM Account Integration

    User->>K8sAPI: Create NIM Account +<br/>API Key Secret<br/>Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate (singleton check)
    Controller->>NGC: Validate API key,<br/>Fetch runtime catalog<br/>TLS 1.2+ / NGC API Key
    NGC-->>Controller: Model catalog +<br/>Registry credentials
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap, Pull Secret,<br/>OpenShift Template

    Note over User, Gateway: Flow 4: Gateway Discovery API

    Dashboard->>ServerAPI: GET /api/v1/gateways<br/>TLS 1.2+ FIPS / Bearer Token
    ServerAPI->>K8sAPI: SelfSubjectAccessReview<br/>(user token passthrough)
    K8sAPI-->>ServerAPI: RBAC decision
    ServerAPI->>K8sAPI: List Gateways, Get Namespaces<br/>(user token passthrough)
    K8sAPI-->>ServerAPI: Gateway list
    ServerAPI-->>Dashboard: Filtered gateway list<br/>(empty if unauthorized)
